            "text": "[TRUE_POSITIVE] Potential CRITICAL race on entity [PriceConfig]. Endpoints create (POST) and delete (DELETE) access it concurrently with at least one WRITE. Protection: UNPROTECTED.\nConfidence: 0.80 | Static: 0.50 | LLM Agreement: 1.00"
          },
          "locations": [
